# Supabase

## Migrations

- Create new migrations with `pnpm run db:migration:new <name>` — never edit already-applied migrations
- After schema changes, run `pnpm run test:rls` (requires Docker + Supabase CLI)
- Verify existing RPCs and functions still work after changes

## RLS

- Every exposed table must have RLS enabled
- Use restrictive policies when direct table access should be blocked
- Prefer `SECURITY DEFINER` RPCs for complex reads across shared lists (see `supabase/migrations/20260522205547_activity_feed.sql`)

## Edge Functions

- Functions live in `supabase/functions/`
- Follow existing patterns in the codebase before adding new endpoints

